In August 2024, {{Player|gLAd|flag=ru}} decided to create a tournament - '''Dinosaurus & Noobs'''. The idea of ​​the tournament is a popularization of QuakeWorld. The tournament features Russian-speaking players from all over the world. According to the plan, the tournament will be played by "old-timers" who have not played QW for many years, as well as "noobs" from other Quake games and other FPS. To increase interest, the tournament includes real prizes. It is planned to hold two or three tournaments per year. Prize winners of previous seasons do not affect the tournaments.

